  "prior_outcome_exposure": "exposed",
  "exposure_record": "Step 1 scan at 0e45d5842ead60791c6aee0f46b583423ce0a91c and Cowley Fig. 1 exposed late published trajectories. Commit 30271435bc79444b99c5636d19308b1841f92a6f fixed the complete S2 Memory/Resolved classes, transcript rule, files and probes. Local qualification 129c5704bf4b098f1e0c59d8ab129cf616696eaa exposed 934/933 deposited, 791/784 distal, 934 Unchanged/620 distal, 329/328 coarse D6 pairs, pool joins, hashes and header anomaly. Twelve fixed 10 kb probes outside all 2801 S2 rows in each of four tracks were already observed, all 480000 probed library-bases had records. Header coverage exceeds the assembly size. Commit b8156c4f466982c560d43133b8483060492f44d0 preserved the unregistered-asset hold. This is an exposed verification of existing metadata. No M24 signal has been inspected at any S2 region.",
  "biological_unit": "Four identifiable pooled murine epidermal stem-cell ATAC libraries at M24, two per history group. Two or three mice per biological replicate are reported. Individual membership, independence and pairing are unknown.",
  "unit_status": "unknown",
  "nesting_and_overlap": "S2/S3, QC summaries, original four M24 tracks and the previously inspected probes are reused within the Cowley study. Intervals and bases are features of each file.",
  "population_and_selection": "All 2801 unique S2 rows on chr1-19/X. Use all eligible GENCODE M9 transcript features. Primary includes the deposited Memory and Resolved rows with no overlap of the entire interval with [TSS0-2000,TSS0+2001) clipped to chromosome bounds. Keep Unchanged for source bookkeeping. Preserve the missing 934th Resolved row as a discrepancy.",
  "contrast": "No biological contrast. Verify identities, eligibility, previously exposed D6 covariate summaries and exact base-encoding checks at 12 fixed off-region probes per library.",
  "endpoint": "Source and sample manifests, per-region selection and S3 joins, resolved denominators, D6 support diagnostics, header/probe metadata, six Git-byte comparisons and preserved historical report.",
  "methods": "Run the original three hash-bound source programs with output redirected to the fresh governed directory. Reuse the pinned pybbi runtime in Ubuntu. Confirm all probes are disjoint from every S2 row before routing to the reader. Query only the original predefined intervals and toy fixture. Compare six derived/config files to canonical historical blobs. Permit only recorded CRLF-to-LF normalization of the two Windows JSON outputs. Preserve the original report bytes. Record package versions and verification.",
  "missingness_and_exclusions": "Use NA for S2 regions without an S3 join. Preserve sparse absent bases separately from explicit zeros and retain header anomalies. Keep unknown animal identity and D6 control abundance unresolved. No research-region query, supplementary cohort, read processing or between-library M24 comparison.",
  "multiplicity": "Metadata verification only. No statistical tests or biological effect estimates.",
